---
// SimpleIsland.astro – a minimal island that draws a green circle with “Hello!”  
// No props or complex logic – just static SVG that renders immediately.

<svg
  width="200"
  height="200"
  style="border:1px solid #ccc; display:block; margin:0 auto;"
>
  <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="#4CAF50" />
  <text
    x="100"
    y="115"
    text-anchor="middle"
    font-size="14"
    fill="#fff"
    font-family="system-ui, sans-serif"
  >
    Hello!
  </text>
</svg>
--- 
